# 🎵 Spotify Clone

A full-stack music streaming web app
built with the MERN Stack.


## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Frontend:** React.js, CSS
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js
- **Database:** MongoDB
- **Authentication:** JWT

## ✨ Features
- 🎵 Music playback controls
- 📋 Playlist management
- 👤 User authentication
- 🔍 Search functionality
- 📱 Responsive design



